---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Pricing | Departure: Fitness Quest" description="Departure is free to download and play on iPhone, with no ads and no subscriptions. Workout tracking, ranks, team battles and the Future Self image all work for free, and optional one-time packs add boosts and extras." ogImage="/social/premium-store.jpg">
  <section class="pt-16 pb-8 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4">Free to play. Seriously.</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Everything you need to train and play is free. Optional one-time packs help you level up faster with XP boosts, extra equipment slots and premium gear.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Free Tier -->
        <div class="bg-surface border-2 border-primary/50 rounded-2xl p-8 relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 bg-primary px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-white">MOST POPULAR</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Free</h3>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-1">$0</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">The free version has no time limit.</p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            {[
              "A full workout log with more than 300 built-in exercises",
              "12 exercise categories, and you can add your own exercises",
              "24 ranks to climb as your workouts earn XP",
              "Four character stats that grow with your training",
              "Personal records found for you automatically",
              "A weekly training schedule from 9 plans, or your own",
              "Create or join a team and fight monsters together",
              "A journey map of 24 monsters to beat in order",
              "Daily and weekly challenge workouts",
              "A team feed with reactions, comments and chat",
              "One free AI Future Self image every week",
              "Progress photos and weekly check-ins",
              "5 equipment slots for your character's gear",
              "Gear that drops from workouts and battles",
              "Anti-cheat rules that keep every score honest",
            ].map(feature => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-sm">{feature}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>

          <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6761634387" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="block text-center bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-colors">
            Download on the App Store
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Premium -->
        <div class="bg-surface border border-surface-light/50 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Premium Packs</h3>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">These are optional one-time purchases, and none of them renew.</p>

          <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <div class="bg-surface-light/30 rounded-xl p-4">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                <h4 class="font-semibold">Starter Pack</h4>
                <span class="text-primary-light font-bold">$4.99</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Earn 25% more XP on every workout, for good. You also get 500 coins, 2 extra AI image credits, and 1 cooldown skip, which lets your team fight again without waiting the usual 24 hours.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-surface-light/30 rounded-xl p-4">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                <h4 class="font-semibold">Pro Pack</h4>
                <span class="text-primary-light font-bold">$9.99</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Unlocks a sixth equipment slot for an amulet and the Forge Banner Pack of 3 team banners. You also get 1,000 coins and 5 extra AI image credits.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-surface-light/30 rounded-xl p-4">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                <h4 class="font-semibold">Elite Pack</h4>
                <span class="text-primary-light font-bold">$19.99</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Everything in the Pro Pack, plus 50% more XP on every workout, for good. It adds the Legendary Banner Pack of 3 banners and the Goblin Treasure Trail, which drops a treasure chest after every Goblin win. In total you get 2,000 coins, 10 extra AI image credits and 3 cooldown skips.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-t border-surface-light/50 pt-4">
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm mb-3 text-text-muted">Coin Packs</h4>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                <div class="bg-surface-light/30 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
                  <p class="font-bold text-gold">500</p>
                  <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">$1.99</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-surface-light/30 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
                  <p class="font-bold text-gold">1,500</p>
                  <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">$4.99</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-surface-light/30 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
                  <p class="font-bold text-gold">5,000</p>
                  <p class="text-text-muted text-xs">$14.99</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-xl p-4">
            <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
              <span class="font-semibold text-text">No subscriptions.</span> You pay once for each purchase. You also earn coins by training and winning battles, so buying them only gets you there faster.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-surface/30">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our philosophy</h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-lg mb-6">
        We think fitness should be open to everyone. The full workout log, ranks, team battles, challenges and the weekly Future Self image all work without paying. A free player can reach Legend, the top rank, and beat every monster. Paid packs let you level faster and add extra equipment slots, banners and gear.
      </p>
      <p class="text-text-muted">
        There are no ads and no subscriptions, and we never sell your data. Departure is a game that rewards you for showing up and training.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
